### 標的比較：2022 年初各投入 50 萬，股利再投入、手續費 6 折
POST http://localhost:8080/api/backtests/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockIds": ["2330", "0050", "00878"],
  "startDate": "2022-01-03",
  "initialCapital": 500000,
  "reinvestDividends": true,
  "includeCosts": true,
  "feeDiscount": 0.6
}

### 標的比較：股利不再投入、不計成本（跟上面比較差多少）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/backtests/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockIds": ["2330", "0050", "00878"],
  "startDate": "2022-01-03",
  "initialCapital": 500000,
  "reinvestDividends": false,
  "includeCosts": false
}

### 錯誤：欄位驗證沒過（應該回 400，列出 3 個錯誤）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/backtests/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockIds": [],
  "initialCapital": 10
}

### 錯誤：查無股票（應該回 404）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/backtests/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockIds": ["9999"],
  "startDate": "2022-01-03",
  "initialCapital": 500000
}

### 條件回測可以選的條件種類
GET http://localhost:8080/api/backtests/conditions

### 條件回測：0050 破 5 日低點買進，漲 10% 停利或跌 5% 停損或持有 20 天
POST http://localhost:8080/api/backtests/strategy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockId": "0050",
  "startDate": "2022-01-03",
  "initialCapital": 500000,
  "entryConditions": [
    { "type": "CLOSE_BELOW_LOWEST_LOW", "value": 5 }
  ],
  "exitConditions": [
    { "type": "TAKE_PROFIT", "value": 10 },
    { "type": "STOP_LOSS", "value": 5 },
    { "type": "HOLDING_DAYS", "value": 20 }
  ],
  "includeCosts": true,
  "feeDiscount": 0.6
}

### 錯誤：停利不能當買進條件（應該回 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/backtests/strategy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockId": "0050",
  "startDate": "2022-01-03",
  "initialCapital": 500000,
  "entryConditions": [ { "type": "TAKE_PROFIT", "value": 10 } ],
  "exitConditions": [ { "type": "STOP_LOSS", "value": 5 } ]
}

### 條件選股：資料庫全部，收盤站上月線
POST http://localhost:8080/api/screener
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conditions": [
    { "type": "CLOSE_ABOVE_MOVING_AVERAGE", "value": 20 }
  ]
}

### 條件選股：指定股票（例如自選股），站上季線且突破一個月高點
POST http://localhost:8080/api/screener
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockIds": ["2330", "0050", "2603"],
  "conditions": [
    { "type": "CLOSE_ABOVE_MOVING_AVERAGE", "value": 60 },
    { "type": "CLOSE_ABOVE_HIGHEST_HIGH", "value": 20 }
  ]
}
